 s,Performance,Tours
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate and learn about the Catawba Nation’s culture 
 at the annual Yap Ye Iswa Festival. \nVisitors can experience dancing\, dr
 umming\, Catawba vendors\, food\, demonstrations\, lecture series\, guided
  nature walks\, the new Catawba Life village and more! \nFree and open to 
 the public!
LOCATION:Catawba Cultural Center\, 1536 Tom Steven Road\, Rock Hill\, SC\,
  29730\, United States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/yap-ye-iswa-festival-2/
END:VEVENT
