BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Van Tour: The First and Second Cherokee Wars
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T170000
UID:10003236-1795856400-1795885200@southcarolina250.com
CATEGORIES:Events,Tours
DESCRIPTION:A van tour with historian and battlefield preservationist Dura
 nt Ashmore to sites of the first and second Cherokee Wars: Fort Prince Geo
 rge\, Keowee\, Eastatoe\, Tomassee\, Esseneca and Fort Rutledge. The Chero
 kees chose some of the most beautiful places in the state for their towns\
 , so come enjoy the fall foliage as we study these tragic wars. \nThe tour
  leaves from Greenville\; meeting spot and end time to be announced. For d
 etails and reservations\, contact Durant Ashmore on Facebook: https://www.
 facebook.com/durant.ashmore
LOCATION:Greenville\, SC (meeting spot TBD)\, TBD\, Greenville\, SC\, 2960
 1\, United States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/van-tour-the-first-and-second-chero
 kee-wars/
END:VEVENT
